334	/* ── Bounds on every session check ────────────────────────────────────────────
335	   `fetch` has no default timeout: a backend that accepts the connection and
336	   then never answers hands back a promise that never settles. That is exactly
337	   how this app once pinned itself on a full-screen loader with no way out.
338	   Every number below exists to make an unbounded wait unrepresentable —
339	   each attempt is aborted, the attempts are counted, and one deadline covers
340	   the entire sequence including the gaps between attempts.
